{"version":1,"content":"<p>在因個人醜聞辭去英偉達行政總裁職務數天後，英偉達創始人黃仁勳首次公開回應外界對於其回歸公司的呼聲。他表示，如果公司董事會認為他的回歸符合股東、員工、公司及美國的最佳利益，他將願意重新出任行政總裁。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586826.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.140277+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:36:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_hash":"caa365a73134f60c93dc6a1b44b7812529180cd797815cc2a16ce9d90dfcf4fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}